    "project_template_level_name": "building-data-driven-systems-lesson11-template-v1-2026",
    "long_instructions": "## Plan Your Values Explorer\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll define the core idea and data for your app.\r\n\r\nOpen `planning.md` and describe:\r\n- what your Values Explorer is about and what value you are exploring\r\n- what kinds of items your app will display\r\n- what users will be able to do (search, filter, sort)\r\n\r\nThis will guide your design, data, and features in the next levels.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Not Sure Where To Start?**]\r\n\r\n</br>\r\n\r\nIf you’re not sure what to write, use AI Tutor to:\r\n- brainstorm a value or theme for your app\r\n- suggest types of items you could include in your dataset\r\n- help you think of useful search, filter, or sort features\r\n\r\n:::",
